    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1159">

                <pb facs="1174" n="1164" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1164"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.115/11–1549: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul General at
                        Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">McConaughy</hi>)<anchor n="8"
                        xml:id="d1159-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-11-15T19:00:00-05:00">November 15,
                            1949—7 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2271. Urtel unnumbered, November 15. Pls endeavor most urgently obtain full
                    report all details regarding Natl gunboat’s attack <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Flying Cloud</hi>. Particularly desire info re fol: Did Natl gunboat signal
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Cloud</hi> and at what position; did gunboat fire
                    warning shot; at what point did gunboat open fire which inflicted damage <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Cloud</hi>.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1159-f1" n="8" type="source" xml:id="d1159-f1-content">
                <p>Repeated to the Chargé in China as telCan No. 757, November 16, 4 p. m.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
